<title>CHILE: TENNIS-RESULTS AT CHILEAN ATP TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT CHILEAN ATP TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results Wednesday from the</p>
<p>Hellmann's Cup ATP tournament (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>3-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Gabriel Silberstein</p>
<p>(Chile) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>4-Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat Nicolas Lapenti (Ecuador) 6-4</p>
<p>6-7 (1-7) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>5-Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat Alejandro Hernandez</p>
<p>(Mexico) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Emilio Alvarez (Spain) beat 6-Galo Blanco (Spain) 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
